\newlabel{tab:cw_frac}{{III}{12}{Global CW fraction across catalog tiers. Uncertainties are $1\sigmaunit $ binomial: $\sigma = \sqrt {p(1-p)/N_{\rm spiral}}$ with $N_{\rm spiral} = 3{,}201{,}160$ (canonical equivariant total; see Sec.~\ref {sec:stats}). The earlier $3{,}321{,}795$ figure used in drafts $\le $\,v1.0.5 reflected a pre-edge-on-redirect snapshot and is superseded for noise-floor purposes}{table.3}{}}
